    "title": "员工门店/仓库权限设置",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><strong>应用场景：</strong> 员工只负责自己所属门店/仓库的管理和开单发货，不能操作其他的门店/仓库。\n<strong>操作步骤：</strong> 设置--员工管理--修改--选择所属门店--勾选仓库--确定</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202408/001a9d1b09b62be53f406211208b4f86.png\" alt=\"Description\">\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202408/bc23f3be18d2a54f3b37e60864a10c49.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>设置好之后营业员开单就只能选择有权限的门店/仓库</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202408/3a0cdc5b2c1f13cc82bcdf3724eaf2eb.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>只能看到有权限门店/仓库的库存数量（包括开单、库存统计、库存查询等查询商品数量的地方）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202408/18af60f958a0bf67c2c345a0b8e8cab2.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202408/0aa82c578cdf784dc100bdb21b6fad8b.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202408/81b875e452598a89bc40a3462056beb9.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
